DESCRIPTION:Topic\n\n:\n\nDBS Career Jam (Cantonese)\n\nSynopsis\n\n:\n\nDo
	 you have questions on internal mobility? Join us as we hear from employee
	s who have done internal mobility\, hiring managers and releasing managers
	 to debunk some of the myths you may have!\n\nSpeaker\n\n:\n\nAmy KWAN\, E
	xecutive Director\, CBG\n\nPony LAU\, Senior Vice President\, GTS\n\nFergu
	s LO\, Vice President\, PB\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n_______________________
	__________________________________________________________________________
	_____________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a laptop or mobile de
	vice through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting L
	ink <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=md15ca29871f19f211dff8c045aa7480
	7> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit here <https://dbs1ba
	nk.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?market=Sing
	apore&category=Communication> to find out more about Webex \n\nMeeting pas
	sword: uyQPpZCv643 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are joining via 
	Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the "Call" i
	con\n2. Dial 25153130291@dbs.webex.com <mailto:25153130291@dbs.webex.com> 
	 into the search bar and press "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter you
	r 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to see how to retrieve your Host K
	EY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%20Documents/Forms/A
	llItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2F
	sgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2E
	pdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2F
	sgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are j
	oining via a laptop through the Web browser: \nFor external parties who do
	 not wish to download the application \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex 
	Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=md15ca29871f19f211dff8c
	045aa74807> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' a
	ppears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and
	 Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick here <https://help.webex.com
	/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting#id_135013> to find out more\n
	\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charg
	es / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you are the host\, please u
	se either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <te
	l:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-301
	8-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-
	0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480
	-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1
	%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2515 313 0291#\nGlobal call-in numbers <http
	s://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Co
	ntact Webex Support Team! <mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com> \n\n \n\n
